        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <li>You require sub-10ms p95 latencies for real-time voice agents or conversational search.</li>
          <li>Your dataset contains complex relational filters (geo-bounding, nested arrays, regex).</li>
          <li>You have strict data sovereignty requirements (GDPR, HIPAA) mandating on-premise execution.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 my-6">
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-2">When You Should Choose Pinecone</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <li>You have zero dedicated DevOps engineers and need set-and-forget serverless scaling.</li>
          <li>Query volume is bursty (e.g. 500 QPS for 10 minutes, then idle for hours).</li>
          <li>Your application architecture already runs 100% on AWS Lambda or Cloudflare Workers.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

